#### Classification Based on Ownership

Finally UAVs - like other aircrafts - can be categorized based on their ownership as _public_ or _state_ when they are owned and operated by public entities like federal agencies or local law enforcement and _civil_ when they are owned by industry or private parties; see Hempe (2006).

